<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila willistoni subcellular Turing wavelength (1.5 µm, 0 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Each modelling step is a named function whose docstring states the equation it implements. The Lean module proves the integer form of the wavelength order, the granule-count order, the onset margin, and the ablation margin, with no sorry. The math-kg file points at those declarations and at the Python lines. Calibration constants remain reconstructions, which the reference JSON says in writing." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila willistoni subcellular Turing wavelength (1.5 µm, 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 keeps the Pass 1 reading of the Jacobian, onset wavenumber, and forward-Euler integrator, and now treats the ablation as executed. With Du = Dv the discriminant is negative, σ_max is negative, and the seeded stripe decays. The focal ratio 13.50 sits above the Schnakenberg onset ratio 11.37, and the fastest mode is 1.466 µm while the onset wavelength is 1.396 µm. That split is the supercritical shift, not a second ad-hoc target. The score stays below 90 because a, b, Du, and Dv are calibrated rather than measured in willistoni epidermis." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-4> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila willistoni subcellular Turing wavelength (1.5 µm, 0 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Commensurate-mode FFT wavelengths match the analytical sqrt scaling with Pearson r = 1, above the 0.98 gate, and RMSE at roundoff (reference tolerance 0.05 µm, not a copy of the RMSE). The noise-seeded hero field measures 1.480 µm against the 1.466 µm assignment. Abdomen KS D is 0.068 against a reference of 0. Specimen coherency and foreground fraction are measured on the rendered frame and referenced to the untouched photograph, and the two numbers are not equal. Granules per cell are referenced to the virilis count, not copied from the willistoni count." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-ablation-control-std-ratio-versus-turing>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-onset-wavelength-k-c>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-simulated-ocellus-dominant-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-abdomen-intensity-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-abdomen-pigment-ks-statistic>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-foreground-fraction>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-structure-tensor-coherency>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-virilis-predecessor-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-wavelength-sweep-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-wavelength-sweep-rmse>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-willistoni-granules-across-epidermal-cell>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-yakuba-successor-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-willistoni-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-3> ;
